        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## How to Interpret the Results\n\n- Stock Selection Conclusion: Linear regressionEW Top-30is the main strategy for this assignment, PW Top-30Enhanced control with higher returns but also higher risk. \n- Additional Question Conclusion: AUChigher0.5Note that the direction is not intended to be reversed., ButMLTiming does not exceed the simple benchmark, Therefore, the strategy should not be claimed to be successful.. \n- Use boundaries: Short main task test period, And missing financial disclosure date, Historical component stocks, Suspension, STand liquidity markers; Results for course backtesting only. "
